    "/dev/simulate-order": {
      "post": {
        "description": "Development only, there is no buyer app, so this stands in for one. It picks 1 to 3 of the shop's\nactive products that have available stock, a quantity of at most 3 (and at most what is available)\nfor each, and a fake buyer. It does not reserve stock: accepting the order does.\nNot available when `APP_ENV` is `production`: the route does not exist and the answer is 404.\n",
        "responses": {
